{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Chaos Sisters",
    "steam_appid": 2664300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chaos sisters is a beat'em up of demon girls fighting their way through monsters and heroes.<br><i>Puna &amp; Sini are two demons slacking on guard duty, when a party of heroes invades their home dungeon! Now surrounded by furious former allies, the sisters have to slay each hero... or The Master will have their heads!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play in two completely different fighting styles: Fiery Puna fights up close and personal with her quick melee combat. Set the battleground ablaze and wreak havoc!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sini barrages enemies with heavy hitting spells. Store spell-charges and combine spells into powerful invocations to utterly annihilate your foes!<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight your way through a prologue and 6 unique stages.<br></li><li>Encounter over 20 unique monsters and conquer 6+ bossfights, not a single recoloured enemy!<br></li><li>Play as two demons with completely different fighting styles.<br></li><li>Talk with the monsters and heroes with character specific dialogue and jokes.<br></li><li>Collect secrets, and uncover the truth of the fateful night.<br></li><li>Over 20 illustrated cutscenes!<br></li><li>Appreciate the wonderful soundtrack.<br></li><li>Enjoy the hand-drawn 2D animation combat-a-palooza!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/5877436de5abe6104025bd9ea6582b78.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chaos sisters is a beat'em up of demon girls fighting their way through monsters and heroes.<br><i>Puna &amp; Sini are two demons slacking on guard duty, when a party of heroes invades their home dungeon! Now surrounded by furious former allies, the sisters have to slay each hero... or The Master will have their heads!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/19ad59c456dba6c7e24c9a1d4d79048a.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play in two completely different fighting styles: Fiery Puna fights up close and personal with her quick melee combat. Set the battleground ablaze and wreak havoc!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.poster.avif?t=1705503767\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.webm?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664300/extras/8e30a8893f6946b6e4c832bd5cd719b7.mp4?t=1705503767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Sini barrages enemies with heavy hitting spells. Store spell-charges and combine spells into powerful invocations to utterly annihilate your foes!<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight your way through a prologue and 6 unique stages.<br></li><li>Encounter over 20 unique monsters and conquer 6+ bossfights, not a single recoloured enemy!<br></li><li>Play as two demons with completely different fighting styles.<br></li><li>Talk with the monsters and heroes with character specific dialogue and jokes.<br></li><li>Collect secrets, and uncover the truth of the fateful night.<br></li><li>Over 20 illustrated cutscenes!<br></li><li>Appreciate the wonderful soundtrack.<br></li><li>Enjoy the hand-drawn 2D animation combat-a-palooza!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chaos sisters is a beat'em up of demon girls fighting their way through monsters and heroes. Fiery Puna fights in close combat hack and slash style, while Sini casts a barrage of spells and combines them to conjure powerful Invocations. Uncover secrets and survive the night!",
